WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.250
Dvin stood on the plain of Ayrarat,

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.235
about thirty-five kilometers
south of modern Yerevan.

3
00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.345
By the sixth century
it was the seat of the catholicos,

4
00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:15.519
head of the Armenian Church.

5
00:00:15.879 --> 00:00:18.895
Far to the south
a new power had risen.

6
00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.765
Under the caliph Umar,

7
00:00:20.805 --> 00:00:24.125
Arab armies conquered
Syria and Mesopotamia,

8
00:00:24.165 --> 00:00:28.483
and in 640 the first of them
came north into Armenia.

9
00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:33.653
Theodoros Rshtuni,
commander of the Armenian forces,

10
00:00:33.693 --> 00:00:35.484
took the field against them.

11
00:00:35.524 --> 00:00:37.234
But a maneuver went wrong,

12
00:00:37.274 --> 00:00:39.252
and the raiders reached Dvin.

13
00:00:39.612 --> 00:00:42.929
They took the capital
despite a stubborn defense.

14
00:00:42.969 --> 00:00:46.499
The Armenian histories tell
of thirty-five thousand

15
00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:48.363
carried into captivity.

16
00:00:48.723 --> 00:00:51.033
It was a raid, not yet a conquest,

17
00:00:51.073 --> 00:00:52.873
and Dvin rose again.

18
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.360
Now the raiders come down
both roads at once.

19
00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.925
Man the walls.

